WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.803
-There's new music
in the works for you.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:04.971
A few weeks ago, you were here.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:05.838
You performed...

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.440
♪ Don't go yet, oh-oh-oh ♪

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.609
-♪ Heeeey ♪

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.111
-♪ Don't go ♪
-And we made so
many TikToks together.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.080
-We did!
I love that you did that.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.581
-I felt bad. I was like,
"Can we do this one?

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:16.883
And can we do this one?
Can we do this one?"

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.317
-No, you're the most fun.
Come on.

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:20.153
But also, I found out
a little trivia

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:21.787
about that song, "Don't Go Yet."

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:26.159
Who helped write that song
that we don't know?

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:29.929
-Well, like, I'm sure, a
lot of people in the audience --

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.965
I don't know if this was your
experience, Jimmy, but I got

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:34.700
a little COVID puppy.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.272
He's a golden retriever,
and his name is Tarzan.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:42.675
And he was in my house,

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.011
and he just, like, barged
into the studio.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.180
And I was with Mike Sabbath
and Scott Harris,

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.816
who I wrote the song with,
and Mike Sabbath was like --

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:52.986
It was actually in this room,
and he kind of ran in here.

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.454
And Mike Sabbath was like...

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.422
♪ Oh, he's on the track ♪

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:58.124
♪ This is fire ♪

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:02.762
And he was recording,
and he put it in the song.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:06.366
And those kind of notes
and the way that, like,

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.903
the tune kind of
made his voice sound

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.771
sounded like
the chorus melody of...

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.639
♪ Oh, don't go yet ♪

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:16.042
And so, that inspired
the chorus of the song, and --

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:17.543
-Here he is.

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:19.512
-When you're songwriting,
if you don't have a chorus,

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.081
you, like, don't really
have a song.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:23.215
So he kind of wrote it.

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:24.484
-I love --

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:25.651
-He's a genius. He's a star.

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:26.985
-He's a genius.

00:01:26.985 --> 00:01:28.988
Tarzan, great wri--
He's probably watching tonight.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.923
Great work, buddy.

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:32.125
-Mommy loves you.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.626
You know, I actually --

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.928
Do you follow Tarzan
on his Instagram account?

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:39.098
He has an Instagram account
called @Tarzandadog.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:40.666
-Yeah, of course.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:42.067
Yeah, of course I do.
-Uh --

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.236
-Are you kidding me? Yeah.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.172
-He has the best posts, bro.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.374
You've gotta follow him, man.
-"TarzanTheDog"?

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.876
-No, "D-A."
"Tarzandadog."

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:52.278
-Yeah, "Tarzandadog."

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.113
-Lorde has her
onion rings account.

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:56.349
I got my dog account.
-Yeah, exactly. Good.

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:59.719
Can we talk about the album?

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:04.490
What's the theme of this album
when it comes out?

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.259
-The theme of the album --

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:08.027
The album is called "Familia."

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:11.831
And I think, like,
just my love of food

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:15.134
and having people kind of gather
around a dinner table

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:20.439
prompted me kind of manifesting
just having a squad around

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:22.975
and having friends around
and friends being kind of like

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.710
your chosen family.

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:26.446
Plus, also, your real family.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:29.581
But it basically --
Just being about community.

00:02:29.581 --> 00:02:31.650
You know, I feel like
so much in our culture,

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.952
it's like, you know, there's --

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.821
there's independence
and, you know --

00:02:35.821 --> 00:02:38.491
very kind of, like,
based on the individual.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.994
And I think this album, for me,
was a lot about interdependence

00:02:41.994 --> 00:02:44.197
and community and, uh --

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.931
And my dog wrote
all the songs.

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:48.134
-[ Laughs ] That's not true.
That's not true.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:53.439
Can we tell people
when to maybe expect it, or no?

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:57.777
-You know what?
I feel like I was gonna say --

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:02.848
My goal is the fall,
but obviously, you never know

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:04.417
what's gonna happen
in the world.

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:07.887
But it is finished, so the fall.

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:09.855
-Camila Cabello,
everybody.

00:03:09.855 --> 00:03:12.157
-[ Laughs ]
-"Familia"!

00:03:12.157 --> 00:03:14.560
"Familia" is coming soon.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.330
And check out "Cinderella"
on Amazon Prime Video

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.232
starting on September 3rd.
We love you.

